<title>USA: Zynaxis completes 40 pct workforce cut.</title>
<headline>Zynaxis completes 40 pct workforce cut.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zynaxis Inc said Tuesday that it has completed a 40 percent reduction in its work force to save cash.</p>
<p>The move follows a decision by Seloc AG in August to end negotiations to buy Zynaxis's Cauldron Process Chemistry Division.</p>
</text>
